  // ??????ï¿½ ??ï¿½??ï¿½??ï¿½ ??ï¿½??ï¿½??ï¿½??ï¿½ updateElectionSelect2 ???????????ï¿½??????ï¿½ ???????ï¿½??ï¿½??ï¿½??ï¿½











  if (!$('#electionVotingOverlay').length || typeof updateElectionSelect2 === 'undefined') {











